":"yululu-f-812015edcc07077404dc","text":"谦虚接士，轻财好施，禄赐虽丰而常不足用","evidence":["yululu-q-b54e3556cd014bd50681"]}],"aliases":[],"mentions":[{"id":"wuzhu-m-o157-wuzhu-p0125","kind":"mention","text":"文中提及","evidence":["wuzhu-q-o157"]},{"id":"yululu-m-d951d0646e29c40b6a96","kind":"mention","text":"评曰：遭罹屯蹇，以正丧身","evidence":["yululu-q-f2c083caa7bec7299207"]},{"id":"yululu-m-6ac6151d9ca402eea265","kind":"mention","text":"本篇原文记及朱据，具体行动与称谓见引文。","evidence":["yululu-q-a77a022899093ea44639"]}]}],"evidence":[{"id":"feipin-q-1cdae0d5c4836b184bbf","section":"chapter-050","block":"b-d2dc14d313c8506f172c","layer":"original","quote":"少曰鲁育，字小虎；前配朱据〖3〗，后配刘纂。","section_title":"妃嫔传第五","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0107.xhtml","index":63,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":89,"end":111,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"panlu-q-b2d25a9519d4ab58d7cb","section":"chapter-061","block":"b-55337a59319992546fa6","layer":"original","quote":"时校事吕壹，操弄威柄，奏按丞相顾雍、左将军朱据等：皆见禁止","section_title":"潘濬陆凯传第十六","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0129.xhtml","index":26,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":29,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"santizhu059-q-2841677f12a5060cc031","section":"chapter-059","block":"b-274375d798484d5833dc","layer":"pei","quote":"《吴历》曰：“晃入，口谏曰：‘太子仁明，显闻四海。今三方鼎峙，实不宜摇动太子，以生众心。愿陛下少垂圣虑；老臣虽死，犹生之年。’叩头流血，辞气不挠。权不纳晃言，斥还田里。","attribution":"裴注·吴历","section_title":"吴主五子传第十四","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0125.xhtml","index":184,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-fb0f95fd607adcc9639a","start":3,"end":87,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"santizhu059-q-3ec4913bce9db826db60","section":"chapter-059","block":"b-d8c890676807d68129bd","layer":"original","quote":"权沉吟者历年〖7〗，﹝一﹞后遂幽闭和。于是骠骑将军朱据、尚书仆射屈晃，率诸将吏泥头自缚〖8〗，连日诣阙请和〖9〗。权登白爵观见〖10〗，甚恶之","section_title":"吴主五子传第十四","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0125.xhtml","index":161,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":71,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"santizhu059-q-46be65f0bbf831bf6966","section":"chapter-059","block":"b-4d9a1f244fa09eb9eba6","layer":"original","quote":"权大怒，族诛正、象〖15〗；据、晃牵入殿，杖一百。﹝二﹞竟徙和于故鄣〖16〗。群司坐谏诛放者十数〖17〗。众咸冤之","section_title":"吴主五子传第十四","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0125.xhtml","index":162,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":57,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"santizhu059-q-97076d40bd0ef56ee0ae","section":"chapter-059","block":"b-d8c890676807d68129bd","layer":"original","quote":"敕据、晃等“无事匆匆〖12〗”。权欲废和立亮。无难督陈正、五营督陈象上书〖13〗，称引“晋献公杀申生〖14〗，立奚齐，晋国扰乱”。又据、晃固谏不止","section_title":"吴主五子传第十四","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0125.xhtml","index":161,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":76,"end":149,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"shaodi-q-b-33155276d789f594176b","section":"chapter-004","block":"b-33155276d789f594176b","layer":"modern","quote":"〖13〗二年：嘉平二年（公元 250）。","section_title":"三少帝纪第四","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0013_split_000.xhtml","index":198,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-235bc158a4eae2a0609a","start":0,"end":20,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"shaodi-q-o043","section":"chapter-004","block":"b-b1c990928436e9ed43da","layer":"original","quote":"嘉平元年春正月，甲午〖1〗，车驾谒高平陵。﹝一﹞太傅司马宣王奏免大将军曹爽、爽弟中领军羲、武卫将军训、散骑常侍彦官〖2〗，以侯就第。戊戌〖3〗，有司奏收黄门张当付廷尉〖4〗；考实其辞，爽与谋不轨。又尚书丁谧、邓飏、何晏，司隶校尉毕轨，荆州刺史李胜，大司农桓范，皆与爽通奸谋〖5〗，夷三族。语在《爽传》。丙午〖6〗，大赦。丁未〖7〗，以太傅司马宣王为丞相；固让，乃止。﹝二﹞","section_title":"三少帝纪第四","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0013_split_000.xhtml","index":180,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":186,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"shaodi-q-o046","section":"chapter-004","block":"b-8bc97b77985c9cc83eeb","layer":"original","quote":"二年夏五月〖13〗，以征西将军郭淮为车骑将军〖14〗。","section_title":"三少帝纪第四","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0013_split_000.xhtml","index":183,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":27,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"shiyi-q-005f200fbc70c2ffe799","section":"chapter-062","block":"b-1bfab7b7bf3112c80af4","layer":"original","quote":"据禁止，历时乃解","section_title":"是仪胡综传第十七","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0131.xhtml","index":178,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":74,"end":82,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"shiyi-q-7f4433dc60ded137a87a","section":"chapter-062","block":"b-1bfab7b7bf3112c80af4","layer":"original","quote":"左将军朱据、廷尉郝普，称蕃有王佐之才〖14〗；普尤与之亲善，常怨叹其屈","section_title":"是仪胡综传第十七","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0131.xhtml","index":178,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":18,"end":53,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"wuzhu-e-o157c-q","section":"chapter-047","block":"b-6a63d6237256eeada959","layer":"original","quote":"丙寅〖9〗，骠骑将军朱据领丞相，燎鹊以祭。","section_title":"吴主传第二","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0101_split_001.xhtml","index":264,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":31,"end":52,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"wuzhu-q-o157","section":"chapter-047","block":"b-6a63d6237256eeada959","layer":"original","quote":"十二年春三月〖8〗，左大司马朱然卒。四月，有两乌衔鹊，堕东馆。丙寅〖9〗，骠骑将军朱据领丞相，燎鹊以祭。﹝三﹞","section_title":"吴主传第二","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0101_split_001.xhtml","index":264,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":55,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"yululu-q-0bc3bb0a84eaf2b2bd7a","section":"chapter-057","block":"b-3d0affa6a2f7b347e525","layer":"original","quote":"权咨嗟将率〖3〗，发愤叹息，追思吕蒙、张温。以为据才兼文武，可以继之，自是拜建义校尉〖4〗，领兵屯湖孰","section_title":"虞陆张骆陆吾朱传第十二","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0121.xhtml","index":469,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":76,"end":127,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"yululu-q-0d0e0925d00ca93e3912","section":"chapter-057","block":"b-cd72c8ae1fc875f424fb","layer":"original","quote":"未到，中书令孙弘谮润据","section_title":"虞陆张骆陆吾朱传第十二","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0121.xhtml","index":472,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":57,"end":68,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"yululu-q-39d588216d96dd83f2b7","section":"chapter-057","block":"b-cd72c8ae1fc875f424fb","layer":"original","quote":"遭二宫构争〖11〗，据拥护太子；言则恳至，义形于色，守之以死","section_title":"虞陆张骆陆吾朱传第十二","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0121.xhtml","index":472,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":11,"end":41,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"yululu-q-58f7c00aac47e0383265","section":"chapter-057","block":"b-fceaee12582b0a667943","layer":"original","quote":"权数责问据，据无以自明，藉草待罪","section_title":"虞陆张骆陆吾朱传第十二","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0121.xhtml","index":471,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":90,"end":106,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"yululu-q-63d6c934ed2b785cda71","section":"chapter-057","block":"b-fceaee12582b0a667943","layer":"original","quote":"据哀其无辜，厚棺敛之","section_title":"虞陆张骆陆吾朱传第十二","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0121.xhtml","index":471,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":63,"end":73,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"yululu-q-6bf3121bde5d1547949a","section":"chapter-057","block":"b-f697bef193d8b1edc443","layer":"original","quote":"补侍御史","section_title":"虞陆张骆陆吾朱传第十二","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0121.xhtml","index":468,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":34,"end":38,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"yululu-q-7134818bc0dedd6a80ad","section":"chapter-057","block":"b-f8ffa20dda39029c2560","layer":"original","quote":"征据尚公主，拜左将军，封云阳侯","section_title":"虞陆张骆陆吾朱传第十二","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0121.xhtml","index":470,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":11,"end":26,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"yululu-q-99b9b5ed969b057e6c82","section":"chapter-057","block":"b-cd72c8ae1fc875f424fb","layer":"original","quote":"遂左迁新都郡丞","section_title":"虞陆张骆陆吾朱传第十二","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0121.xhtml","index":472,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":45,"end":52,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"yululu-q-9e6dfc8611d6ccf97dfa","section":"chapter-057","block":"b-cd72c8ae1fc875f424fb","layer":"original","quote":"因权寝疾，弘为诏书，追赐死。时年五十七","section_title":"虞陆张骆陆吾朱传第十二","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0121.xhtml","index":472,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":73,"end":92,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"yululu-q-a77a022899093ea44639","section":"chapter-057","block":"b-eef43528688286740d84","layer":"pei","quote":"﹝一﹞殷基《通语》载据争曰：“臣闻太子，国之本根；雅性仁孝，天下归心。今猝责之，将有一朝之虑。昔晋献用骊姬而申生不存，汉武信江充而戾太子冤死。臣窃惧太子不堪其忧；虽立思子之宫，无所复及矣！”","attribution":"裴注·殷基通语","section_title":"虞陆张骆陆吾朱传第十二","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0121.xhtml","index":489,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-a7732515a6c6b87fd48f","start":0,"end":95,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"yululu-q-ad37ef211e7d7346dcb3","section":"chapter-057","block":"b-f697bef193d8b1edc443","layer":"original","quote":"黄武初，征拜五官郎中","section_title":"虞陆张骆陆吾朱传第十二","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0121.xhtml","index":468,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":23,"end":33,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"yululu-q-aeedb4978359914b4e4f","section":"chapter-057","block":"b-cd72c8ae1fc875f424fb","layer":"original","quote":"赤乌九年，迁骠骑将军","section_title":"虞陆张骆陆吾朱传第十二","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0121.xhtml","index":472,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":10,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"yululu-q-b54e3556cd014bd50681","section":"chapter-057","block":"b-f8ffa20dda39029c2560","layer":"original","quote":"黄龙元年，权迁都建业。征据尚公主，拜左将军，封云阳侯。谦虚接士，轻财好施，禄赐虽丰而常不足用。","section_title":"虞陆张骆陆吾朱传第十二","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0121.xhtml","index":470,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":47,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"yululu-q-cc08f1b58793dcd5960c","section":"chapter-057","block":"b-3d0affa6a2f7b347e525","layer":"original","quote":"据以为：“天下未定，宜以功覆过，弃瑕取用，举清厉浊，足以沮劝〖2〗；若一时贬黜，惧有后咎。”艳不听，卒败","section_title":"虞陆张骆陆吾朱传第十二","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0121.xhtml","index":469,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":23,"end":75,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"yululu-q-eaf4845207afc74b848d","section":"chapter-057","block":"b-eef43528688286740d84","layer":"pei","quote":"﹝一﹞殷基《通语》载据争曰：“臣闻太子，国之本根；雅性仁孝，天下归心。今猝责之，将有一朝之虑。昔晋献用骊姬而申生不存，汉武信江充而戾太子冤死。臣窃惧太子不堪其忧；虽立思子之宫，无所复及矣！”","attribution":"裴注·《通语》","section_title":"虞陆张骆陆吾朱传第十二","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0121.xhtml","index":489,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-a7732515a6c6b87fd48f","start":0,"end":95,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"yululu-q-f2c083caa7bec7299207","section":"chapter-057","block":"b-88aca22865401281bdfd","layer":"original","quote":"评曰：虞翻古之狂直〖1〗，固难免乎末世〖2〗；然权不能容，非旷宇也〖3〗！陆绩之于扬《玄》〖4〗，是仲尼之左丘明〖5〗，老聃之严周矣〖6〗；以瑚琏之器〖7〗，而作守南越〖8〗：不亦贼夫人欤〖9〗？张温才藻俊茂；而智防未备，用致艰患。骆统抗明大义〖10〗，辞切理至，值权方闭不开。陆瑁笃义规谏，君子有称焉。吾粲、朱据遭罹屯蹇〖11〗，以正丧身：悲夫！","section_title":"虞陆张骆陆吾朱传第十二","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0121.xhtml","index":490,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":174,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"yululu-q-fe17af15245c1478870b","section":"chapter-057","block":"b-f697bef193d8b1edc443","layer":"original","quote":"朱据字子范，吴郡吴人也。有姿貌膂力，又能论难。黄武初，征拜五官郎中。补侍御史。","section_title":"虞陆张骆陆吾朱传第十二","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0121.xhtml","index":468,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":39,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"zhanggu-q-8d3b350a49a6d8204652","section":"chapter-052","block":"b-731a4f7dcbb9861aef8c","layer":"pei","quote":"雍族人悌，字子通。以孝悌廉正，闻于乡党。年十五为郡吏，除郎中。稍迁偏将军。权末年，嫡庶不分；悌数与骠骑将军朱据共陈祸福，言辞切直，朝廷惮之","attribution":"裴注·吴书","section_title":"张顾诸葛步传第七","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0111.xhtml","index":172,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-5a9c7df73f863da1ddae","start":371,"end":440,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"zhulv-q-bf0fe7dd248bc8b239df","section":"chapter-056","block":"b-7fa5ae018283aedeaf41","layer":"original","quote":"权与论攻战，辞对称意。权谓异从父骠骑将军据曰：“本知季文〖3〗，及见之复过所闻","section_title":"朱治朱然吕范朱桓传第十一","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0119.xhtml","index":283,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":39,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"zhulv-q-c20c42a0c7251ec2bef1","section":"chapter-056","block":"b-8b03e77ec4d976d2f885","layer":"pei","quote":"张惇子纯与张俨及异，俱童少，往见骠骑将军朱据。据闻三人才名，欲试之，告曰：‘老鄙相闻，饥渴甚矣！夫骠以迅骤为功，鹰隼以轻疾为妙。其为吾各赋一物，然后乃坐。’俨乃赋犬曰：‘守则有威，出则有获。韩卢、宋鹊，书名竹帛。’纯赋席曰：‘席以冬设，簟为夏施。揖让而坐，君子攸宜。’异赋弩曰：‘南岳之干，钟山之铜。应机命中，获隼高墉。’三人各随其目所见而赋之，皆成而后坐：据大欢悦","attribution":"裴注·文士传","section_title":"朱治朱然吕范朱桓传第十一","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0119.xhtml","index":294,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-718ca0bdd43c32f19b69","start":11,"end":194,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"}],"profiles":{},"directory_counts":{}}
